WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.466 --> 00:00:11.784
Let me share with you my story.

00:00:12.352 --> 00:00:15.421
Knowing this truth will change your life forever.

00:00:15.421 --> 00:00:18.388
This dimension is not the only one there is...

00:00:18.388 --> 00:00:23.373
There&nbsp;are other beings out there
that exist that are real

00:00:23.373 --> 00:00:27.249
that's influencing this physical world&nbsp;
but you just can't see it.

00:00:27.389 --> 00:00:31.207
The entertainment industry 
is trying to change the truth...

00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:34.840
This&nbsp;is the real battle
between truth and lies...

00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:46.620
Demons do not stand a chance
against God!

